{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787029933734576001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"flamboyant-possessive-blackbuck","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"0c67377ffd336bc562401209cd5b06ddc7f7b1d358174d0553ab5e8dd5709d52","event_uuid":"d814f485-d304-4c25-9513-1e6e6e380c91","position":{"commit_sha":"c652fffdecb74a8910d777417480c1ab96bb5857","position":"1787027694151845001-d814f485-d304-4c25-9513-1e6e6e380c91"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"13e9aa22a35aff682b1afa42bce716d97cc0a8c36f944f713280488e8eaf26dc","event_uuid":"ee0934b4-846f-4b8b-b740-452f34ea26ff","position":{"commit_sha":"26122d9fcb9c683022701ef5d034aa12cafb0995","position":"1787027706098129001-ee0934b4-846f-4b8b-b740-452f34ea26ff"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e4d2c2a7cbc73c546d7a35df46af965b053ec01a46f5cd441a851ec7cc347253","event_uuid":"f8852eab-9554-41db-814b-3aaedb0b1f08","position":{"commit_sha":"258d655b62d4c1183741b21cc7821a9695f0e0a9","position":"1787027712354009001-f8852eab-9554-41db-814b-3aaedb0b1f08"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"c3e6315932b34eb9e0e92feccbed1e1b6e3b34850fa62d93533188018680349e","event_uuid":"59fc10da-92cf-4c74-87bb-9a65d2935a25","position":{"commit_sha":"86387de0c0f6dc965162a0cf5095a8aa4b7d80f3","position":"1787027721980726001-59fc10da-92cf-4c74-87bb-9a65d2935a25"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787027694151845001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"59fc10da-92cf-4c74-87bb-9a65d2935a25","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"c4f7-82ff-1004-4da5"}],"description":"## Context\nConstruction-time or preview-time repair would violate read-only commands. Retirement completion is safe only after operation config is frozen, provider preflight and exclusive ownership succeed, and under-lock staleness validation passes.\n\n## Outcome\nInvoke the S3 recovery operation once at the validated write-bearing reconcile boundary before remote observation; every read-only or filtered path remains zero-write.\n\n## Plan\n1. Add spies around repository save and `os.replace` for construction, load, reconcile-check, dry-run, preview, selection, filtering, and live passes.\n2. Place recovery after immutable operation snapshot, preflight, exclusive pass ownership, and staleness validation, but before remote issue fetch, binding walk, differ, or lifecycle mutation.\n3. Treat a durable tombstone as authoritative until explicit `unretire`; automatic 200, `clear_absent`, or same-key confirmation cannot revoke it.\n4. On completion failure, abort before remote observation and preserve the overlap for retry.\n\n## Testing\nOrder-spy tests pin each predecessor/successor and zero provider calls on recovery failure. Read-only tables assert zero replacement calls.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A live write-bearing pass completes exact recovery after all validation gates and before its first remote observation.\n- [ ] Construction, load, check, dry-run, preview, selection, and filtered paths perform zero recovery writes.\n- [ ] Recovery failure performs zero remote calls and preserves recoverable evidence.\n- [ ] Automatic success/reset/same-key confirmation does not override the tombstone.\n- [ ] Explicit `unretire` removes the tombstone and therefore removes the completion candidate.\n\n## Out of scope\nRich-emission caller cutover and ADR finalization.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py","reason":"Invoke recovery at the validated pre-observation write boundary."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/binding_recovery.py","reason":"Expose ordered completion and typed safety-abort outcomes."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_recovery_write_boundary.py","reason":"Order and zero-write read-only surface tests."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_binding_recovery.py","reason":"Tombstone-authority and failure-preservation regressions."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","c4f7-82ff-1004-4da5"],["parent","486a-69ef-6370-48ff"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"486a-69ef-6370-48ff","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp02","binding-recovery","tdd"],"ticket_id":"90a5-6a33-5cda-4064","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-02 S3 T2 — Invoke recovery only at the validated write boundary","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_recovery_write_boundary.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_binding_recovery.py","dd_id":"AC1-AC5","dd_text":"Validated boundary ordering, read-only zero writes, failure containment, and tombstone reversal"}]},"source_event_uuids":["d814f485-d304-4c25-9513-1e6e6e380c91","ee0934b4-846f-4b8b-b740-452f34ea26ff","f8852eab-9554-41db-814b-3aaedb0b1f08","59fc10da-92cf-4c74-87bb-9a65d2935a25"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787029933734576001,"uuid":"3d9dc0ac-2233-4da6-afc7-c247e5f79f88"}